OPTIONAL MCP SERVER (mcp-server/, docker compose profile "mcp")
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MCP server has its own dependency set, inventoried in:

    mcp-server/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

Dependencies there with obligations that survive redistribution:

  * paramiko            - LGPL-2.1
  * certifi             - MPL-2.0
  * orjson              - MPL-2.0 AND (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)

Its image adds Debian packages, among them git and iproute2 (GPL-2.0), under
the same source offer as above. The profile also runs three upstream images that
CoreSpan does not build or modify: agentgateway (Apache-2.0),
tecnativa/docker-socket-proxy (Apache-2.0, on an HAProxy base, GPL-2.0) and
Keycloak (Apache-2.0). Their inventories are in sbom/ (make sbom-mcp).

